What is Ice Wine?
Ice Wine is a premium dessert wine made from grapes naturally frozen on the vine, creating intensely concentrated sugars and flavors. Unlike regular wines, ice wine production requires precise climatic conditions with temperatures below -8°C during harvest. This labor-intensive process results in limited yields (typically 5-15% of normal wine production) but creates a luxurious product with perfect balance between sweetness and acidity.
